NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000148 "recent releases; the original author is Kenneth J. Albanowski"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000149 "<kjahds@kjahds.com>.  Thanks to Hack Kampbjørn and Slaven Rezic for"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000150 "patches and bug reports."
